<view class="page stack"><view class="title">基础代谢估算</view><view class="seg"><view data-sex="female" bindtap="sex" class="{{sex==='female'?'on':''}}">女</view><view data-sex="male" bindtap="sex" class="{{sex==='male'?'on':''}}">男</view></view><input class="field" type="number" placeholder="年龄" data-key="age" bindinput="input"/><input class="field" type="digit" placeholder="身高 cm" data-key="height" bindinput="input"/><input class="field" type="digit" placeholder="体重 kg" data-key="weight" bindinput="input"/><button class="button-primary" bindtap="calc">估算</button><view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card result">约 {{result}} kcal / 天<text>这是静息状态估算值，不是每日建议摄入量。</text></view></view>
